D3D12: resources are created as ID3D12Resource2, which the inbox runtime has.

3dd4cbfa made ID3D12ResourceBest ID3D12Resource3 in BufferD3D12.h and TextureD3D12.h. The device
and the command lists are queried down to what the runtime offers (QueryLatestInterface, "Using
ID3D12Device14" on the inbox runtime), but every resource is created through
IID_PPV_ARGS(&m_Buffer) / IID_PPV_ARGS(&m_Texture), i.e. for ID3D12Resource3, which the inbox
runtime does not implement. So with NRI_ENABLE_AGILITY_SDK_SUPPORT and no Agility SDK in the
process, every committed, bound and placed buffer and texture fails with E_NOINTERFACE:
"D3D12MA::CreateResource3(): failed, result = 0x80004002" (committed) and
"ID3D12Device10::CreatePlacedResource2(): failed, result = 0x80004002" (bound or placed), returned
as INVALID_SDK. With the D3D12 debug layer on, the bound-buffer failure ends the process
(0xC0000409) without a message. RenderDoc, which captures only the inbox runtime, can no longer
run any NRI frame.

NRI calls none of ID3D12Resource3's additions (GetDesc2, GetCastableFormatsCount,
GetCastableFormats), so this goes back to ID3D12Resource2.

Measured on Windows 11 26200 (inbox runtime, "Using ID3D12Device14"), NVIDIA RTX 4070 SUPER, main
7ea93bb5: committed buffer, committed texture, bound buffer, bound texture, placed buffer and
placed texture all fail without the patch and all succeed with it; v191 (46c93d79) succeeds too.
With the Agility SDK 1.620 ("Using ID3D12Device16") all six succeed either way.

diff --git a/Source/D3D12/BufferD3D12.h b/Source/D3D12/BufferD3D12.h
index 0ccc9665..99c19127 100644
--- a/Source/D3D12/BufferD3D12.h
+++ b/Source/D3D12/BufferD3D12.h
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #if NRI_ENABLE_AGILITY_SDK_SUPPORT
-typedef ID3D12Resource3 ID3D12ResourceBest;
+typedef ID3D12Resource2 ID3D12ResourceBest; // not "ID3D12Resource3": the inbox runtime lacks it, and its methods are unused
 #else
 typedef ID3D12Resource ID3D12ResourceBest;
 #endif
diff --git a/Source/D3D12/TextureD3D12.h b/Source/D3D12/TextureD3D12.h
index e43c25d9..6ba1700d 100644
--- a/Source/D3D12/TextureD3D12.h
+++ b/Source/D3D12/TextureD3D12.h
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #if NRI_ENABLE_AGILITY_SDK_SUPPORT
-typedef ID3D12Resource3 ID3D12ResourceBest;
+typedef ID3D12Resource2 ID3D12ResourceBest; // not "ID3D12Resource3": the inbox runtime lacks it, and its methods are unused
 #else
 typedef ID3D12Resource ID3D12ResourceBest;
 #endif
